{"text": "Jemima flew over the treetops and saw an open place in the wood. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She landed rather heavily and waddled about to find a dry place for a nest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She liked a tree stump among some tall foxgloves. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But a well dressed gentleman was sitting on the stump, reading a newspaper. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had black pointed ears and sandy whiskers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was sitting on his long bushy tail, because the stump was a little damp. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Madam, have you lost your way, he asked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jemima thought that he was very polite and handsome. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She told him that she was looking for a dry place to make a nest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I have a sackful of feathers in my wood shed, said the gentleman. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You may sit there as long as you like.", "alignment": {"characters": ["J", "e", "m", "i", "m", "a", " ", "f", "l", "e", "w", " ", "o", "v", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", "t", "o", "p", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "a", "w", " ", "a", "n", " ", "o", "p", "e", "n", " ", "p", "l", "a", "c", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "o", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "l", "a", "n", "d", "e", "d", " ", "r", "a", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "h", "e", "a", "v", "i", "l", "y", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "a", "d", "d", "l", "e", "d", " ", "a", "b", "o", "u", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "f", "i", "n", "d", " ", "a", " ", "d", "r", "y", " ", "p", "l", "a", "c", "e", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "a", " ", "n", "e", "s", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", "d", " ", "a", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", " ", "s", "t", "u", "m", "p", " ", "a", "m", "o", "n", "